4458   EQ28(j,z,time)          Government receipts of indirect taxes on production of industry j
4459   EQ29(i,z,time)          Government receipts of indirect taxes on commodity i
4460   EQ30(i,zj,z,time)       Government receipts of indirect taxes on imports of commodity i
4461   EQ31(i,z,zj,time)       Government receipts of indirect taxes on exports of commodity i
4462   EQ32(z,time)            Government savings
4463   EQ33(z,time)            Rest of the world total income
4464   EQ34(z,time)            Rest of the world savings
4465   EQ35(z,time)            Equivalence between current account balance and savings
4466   
4467  * --- Demand and Trade ---
4468   EQ36(i,z,time)          Household consumption of commodity i
4469   EQ37(i,z,time)          Final demand of commodity i for investment purposes
4470   EQ38(i,z,time)          Public final consumption of commodity i
4471   EQ39(i,z,time)          Total intermediate consumption of commodity i
4472   EQ39_1(i,z,time)        Total intermediate consumption of commodity i
4473   EQ39_2(i,z,time)        Total intermediate consumption of commodity i
4474   EQ40_3(i,z,time)        Domestic supply by commdities
4475   EQ40_4(j,z,time)        Total supply by commdities
4476   EQ40_5(i,z,time)        CET function between exports local production and margins
4477   EQ41(i,z,time)          Supply of composite exports
4478   EQ42(i,z,time)          Supply of margins
4479   EQ43(i,z,time)          CET function between exports by trading partner
4480   EQ44(i,z,zj,time)       Supply of exports by trading partner
4481   EQ45(i,z,time)          CES function between composite imports and local production
4482   EQ46(i,z,time)          Demand for composite imports
4483   EQ47(i,z,time)          CES function between imports by origin
4484   EQ48(i,zj,z,time)       Demand for imports by origin
4485   
4486  * --- Prices ---
4487   EQ49(j,z,time)          Producer price in energy industries j after production taxes
4488   EQ49_1(j,z,time)        Producer price in industry j after production taxes
4489   EQ50(j,z,time)          Basic price of industry j production
4490   EQ51(j,z,time)          Price index of industry j intermediate consumption
4491   EQ51_1(j2,z,time)       Price index nested CES
4492   EQ51_2(j3,z,time)       Price index nested CES
4493   EQ51_3(j2,z,time)       Price index nested CES
4494   EQ51_4(j2,z,time)       Price index nested CES
4495   EQ51_5(j2,z,time)       Price index nested CES
4496   EQ51_6(j2,z,time)       Price index nested CES
4497   EQ52(j,z,time)          Value added price
4498   EQ52_1(j,z,time)        KLE price
4499   EQ53(j,z,time)          Price of composite labor in industry j (redundant)
4500   EQ54(j,z,time)          Wages including taxes
4501   EQ54_1(ene,j,z,time)    Energy commodity prices
4502   EQ56(k,j,z,time)        Rental rate including taxes
4503   EQ58(i,z,time)          Producer price is a weighted sum of PE and PL
4504   EQ60(i,z,zj,time)       Border price of exported commodity i
4505   EQ61(i,z,time)          Price of local product i (including all taxes and margins)
4506   EQ62(i,zj,z,time)       Price of imported commodity i (including all taxes and duties)
4507   EQ64(i,z,time)          Consumer price is a weighted sum of PD and PM
4508   EQ66(z,time)            GDP deflator (Fischer index)
4509   EQ67(time)              World GDP deflator (Fischer index)
4510   EQ68(z,time)            Consumer price index (Laspeyres)
4511   EQ69(z,time)            Investment price index (derived from investment function)
4512   EQ70(z,time)            Public expenditure price index
4513   
4514  * --- Equilibrium and Macro ---
4515   EQ71(i1,z,time)         Domestic absorbtion
4516   EQ72(z,time)            Labor supply equals labor demand
4517   EQ73(k,z,time)          Capital supply equals capital demand
4518   EQ74(z,time)            Total investment equals total savings
4519   EQ75(z,time)            Depreciation
4520   EQ76(i,z,time)          Supply of domestic production equals demand
4521   EQ77(i,z,zj,time)       Exports supply equals imports demand
4522   EQ78(i,z,zj,time)       Exports price equals imports price
4523   EQ79(i,time)            World demand for margins equals world supply
4524   EQ81(z,time)            GDP at basic prices
4525   EQ82(z,time)            GDP at market prices
4526   EQ83(z,time)            GDP at market prices (income-based)
4527   EQ84(z,time)            GDP at market prices (expenditure-based)
4528   EQ85(time)              World GDP
4529   EQ86(z,time)            Real consumption budget of type h households
4530   EQ87(z,time)            Real current government expenditures on goods and services
4531   EQ88(z,time)            Real GDP at basic prices
4532   EQ89(time)              Real world GDP at basic prices
4533   EQ90(z,time)            Real GDP at market prices
4534   EQ91(z,time)            Real gross fixed capital formation
4535   EQ92(z,time)            Current account balance of region z in terms of the reference currency
4536   WALRAS(z,time)          Walras law verification
4537   
4538  * --- Nested Trade & Output ---
4539   EQA_1(z,time)           Top Nest - Leontief function Aggregated-Electricity
4540   EQA_2(Z,time)           Top Nest - Leontief function Aggregated-Electricity
4541   EQA_3(BS, Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, time)       Top Nest - Other
4542   EQA_3_OTH(BS, Conv, I_BS, Z_OTH, time)  Top Nest - OTH IRONSTAL
4543   EQA_4(z,time)           Second Nest - CES function - Aggregated-Electricity
4544   EQA_5(POWER,i,z,time)   Second Nest - CES function - Aggregated-Electricity
4545   EQA_6(BS, Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, time)       Second Nest - CES function - Aggregated-Backstop
4546   EQA_7_CONV(BS, Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, time)
4547   EQA_7_BS(BS, Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, time)
4548   EQB_1(i2,z,time)        Industry j production of commodity i (CES)
4549   EQB_2(j,i2,z,time)      Industry j production
4550   EQB_3(j,i,z,time)       Total producer price is equal to P if there is only one product
4551   EQB_4(j,i,z,time)       Basic price of industry js production of commodity i
4552   EQB_5(j,i,z,time)       Supply of exports for compsite activity
4553   
4554  * --- Dynamics and Labor ---
4555   EQ94(z,time)            Total investment expenditure constraint
4556   EQ95(z,time)            Aggregate price of capital
4557   EQ96(k,bus,z,time)      Investment demand by industry
4558   EQ97a(z,time)           Interest rate (weighted average rate of return on capital)
4559   EQ97b(z,time)           User cost of capital
4560   EQ106(z,time)           Labor supply
4561   
4562  * --- Climate Policy (CTAX, Permits, DAC) ---
4563   EQ107(j,z,time)         Permit calculation by sector
4564   EQ108(z,time)           Total permits
4565   EQ108_1(time)           Total permits NEA
4566   EQ109(z,time)           Carbon tax rebate
4567   EQ110(j,z,time)         Wage share for rebate
4568   EQ111(j,z,time)         Labor rebate
4569   EQ118(z,time)           DAC volume
4570   EQ_OBJ                  Objective function
4571   
4572  * --- Green Steel (VAT Nest) ---
4573   EQ_TSFMKT(BS,Z_GRN,time)   TSF Market clearing condition
4574   EQ_TSFD(BS,Z_GRN,time)     Demand function for TSF (Leontief)
4575   EQ_VAT_REQ(BS,Z_GRN, time) VAT composite requirement
4576   EQ_PVAT(BS,Z_GRN, time)    Price of VAT composite
4577   EQ_VA_GRN(BS,Z_GRN, time)  Value added for Green Steel
4578   EQ_PP_GRN(BS,Z_GRN, time)  Producer price for Green Steel
4579  ;
4580   
4581  *==============================================================================
4582  * 5.3 Equation Definitions
4583  *==============================================================================
4584   
4585  *==============================================================================
4586  * 5.3.1 Production
4587  *==============================================================================
4588  EQ1(j3,z,t)$[not BS(j3)]..
4589      VA(j3,z,t) =e= v(j3,z) * XST(j3,z,t);
4590   
4591   EQ1_1(j2,z,t)..
4592      KLE(j2,z,t) =e= v2(j2,z) * XST(j2,z,t);
4593   
4594   EQ2(j,z,t)..
4595      CI(j,z,t) =e= io(j,z) * XST(j,z,t);
4596   
4597   EQ2_1(j3,z,t)..
4598      CE(j3,z,t) =e= io2(j3,z) * XST(j3,z,t);
4599   
4600   EQ3(j,z,t)$[XSTO(j,z)]..
4601      VA(j,z,t) =e= A_VA(z,t) * B_VA_t(j,z,t) * {
4602                    [beta_VA(j,z) * LDC(j,z,t)**(-rho_VA(j,z))]$LDCO(j,z)
4603                  + [(1 - beta_VA(j,z)) * KDC(j,z,t)**(-rho_VA(j,z))]$KDCO(j,z)
4604                  }**(-1 / rho_VA(j,z));
4605   
4606   EQ3_1(j2,z,t)..
4607      KLE(j2,z,t) =e= B_KLE(j2,z) * {
4608                      [beta_KLE(j2,z) * VA(j2,z,t)**(-rho_KLE(j2,z))]$VAO(j2,z)
4609                    + [(1 - beta_KLE(j2,z)) * CE(j2,z,t)**(-rho_KLE(j2,z))]$CEO(j2,z)
4610                    }**(-1 / rho_KLE(j2,z));
4611   
4612  EQ4_1(j2,z,t)$[VAO(j2,z) and CEO(j2,z)]..
4613      VA(j2,z,t) * (beta_KLE2(j2,z)**sigma_KLE(j2,z)) * (PVA(j2,z,t)**sigma_KLE(j2,z))
4614      =e= ((1 - beta_KLE2(j2,z))**sigma_KLE(j2,z)) * (PCE(j2,z,t)**sigma_KLE(j2,z)) * CE(j2,z,t);
4615   
4616   EQ4(j,z,t)$[LDCO(j,z) and KDCO(j,z)]..
4617      LDC(j,z,t) =e= {[beta_VA(j,z) / (1 - beta_VA(j,z))]
4618                     *[RC(j,z,t) / WC(j,z,t)]}**sigma_VA(j,z) * KDC(j,z,t);
4619   
4620   EQ5(j,z,t)$LDCO(j,z)..
4621      LDC(j,z,t) =e= LD(j,z,t);
4622   
4623   EQ7(j,z,t)$KDCO(j,z)..
4624      KDC(j,z,t) =e= B_KD(j,z) * SUM[k$KDO(k,j,z), beta_KD(k,j,z)
4625                     * KD(k,j,z,t)**(-rho_KD(j,z))]**(-1 / rho_KD(j,z));
4626   
4627   EQ8(k,j,z,t)$KDO(k,j,z)..
4628      KD(k,j,z,t) =e= [beta_KD(k,j,z) * RC(j,z,t) / RTI(k,j,z,t)]**sigma_KD(j,z)
4629                    * B_KD(j,z)**(sigma_KD(j,z) - 1) * KDC(j,z,t);
4630   
4631   EQ9(nene,j,z,t)..
4632      DI(nene,j,z,t) =e= aij_t(nene,j,z,t) * CI(j,z,t);
4633   
4634   EQ9_1(ene,j3,z,t)..
4635      DE(ene,j3,z,t) =e= aij2_t(ene,j3,z,t) * CE(j3,z,t) * AEEI(z,t);
4636   
4637  *============================= Level 1, 2, 3 (CES Energy Nesting) =====================
4638   EQ9_2(j2,z,t)..
4639      CE(j2,z,t) =e= B_ENER_elec(j2,z) * {
4640                     [(beta_ENER_elec(j2,z)) * DEelec(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER_elec(j2,z))]
4641                   + [(1 - beta_ENER_elec(j2,z)) * DEnelec(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER_elec(j2,z))]
4642                   }**(-1 / rho_ENER_elec(j2,z));
4643   
4644   EQ9_3(j2,z,t)..
4645      DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= {[(1 - beta_ENER_elec(j2,z)) / (beta_ENER_elec(j2,z))]
4646                          *[PCEelec(j2,z,t) / PCEnelec(j2,z,t)]}**sigma_ENER_elec(j2,z) * DEelec(j2,z,t);
4647   
4648   EQ9_4(j2,z,t)..
4649      DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= B_ENER_nelec(j2,z) * {
4650                          [(beta_ENER_nelec(j2,z)) * DEcoalgas(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER_nelec(j2,z))]
4651                        + [(1 - beta_ENER_nelec(j2,z)) * DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER_nelec(j2,z))]
4652                        }**(-1 / rho_ENER_nelec(j2,z));
4653   
4654   EQ9_5(j2,z,t)..
4655      DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) =e= {[(1 - beta_ENER_nelec(j2,z)) / (beta_ENER_nelec(j2,z))]
4656                              *[PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t) / PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)]}**sigma_ENER_nelec(j2,z) * DEcoalgas(j2,z,t);
4657   
4658   EQ9_6(ene2,j2,z,t)..
4659      DE(ene2,j2,z,t) =e= DEelec(j2,z,t) * AEEI(z,t);
4660   
4661   EQ9_7(ene5,j2,z,t)..
4662      DE(ene5,j2,z,t) =e= [beta_ENER_coalgas(ene5,j2,z) * PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t) / (P4(ene5,j2,z,t) + P4(ene5,j2,z,t) * CTAX(z,t) * CO2FACTOR2(ene5,j2,z,t))]
4663                          **sigma_ENER_coalgas(j2,z) * B_ENER_coalgas(j2,z)**(sigma_ENER_coalgas(j2,z) - 1)
4664                          * DEcoalgas(j2,z,t) * AEEI(z,t);
4665   
4666   EQ9_8(ene6,j2,z,t)..
4667      DE(ene6,j2,z,t) =e= [beta_ENER_oilprod(ene6,j2,z) * PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) / (P4(ene6,j2,z,t) + P4(ene6,j2,z,t) * CTAX(z,t) * CO2FACTOR2(ene6,j2,z,t))]
4668                          **sigma_ENER_oilprod(j2,z) * B_ENER_oilprod(j2,z)**(sigma_ENER_oilprod(j2,z) - 1)
4669                          * DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) * AEEI(z,t);
4670   
4671  *==============================================================================
4672  * 5.3.2 Income and savings
4673  *==============================================================================
4674   EQ10(z,t)..
4675      YH(z,t) =e= YHL(z,t) + YHK(z,t) + REBATE(z,t) * recycle_hou(z,t)
4676                + SUM((BS, Z_GRN)$sameas(z, Z_GRN), PTSF(BS, Z_GRN, t) * TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t));
4677   
4678   EQ11(z,t)..
4679      YHL(z,t) =e= SUM[(j)$LDO(j,z), W(z,t) * (LD(j,z,t))];
4680   
4681   EQ12(z,t)..
4682      YHK(z,t) =e= SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z), R(k,j,z,t) * (KD(k,j,z,t))];
4683   
4684   EQ13(z,t)..
4685      YDH(z,t) =e= YH(z,t) - TDH(z,t);
4686   
4687   EQ14(z,t)..
4688      CTH(z,t) =e= YDH(z,t) - SH(z,t);
4689   
4690   EQ15(z,t)..
4691      SH(z,t) =e= PIXCON(z,t)**eta * sh0(z,t) + sh1(z,t) * YDH(z,t);
4692   
4693  *==============================================================================
4694  * 5.3.2.2 Government
4695  *==============================================================================
4696   EQ16(z,t)..
4697      YG(z,t) =e= TDH(z,t) + TPRODN(z,t) + TPRCTS(z,t) + REBATE(z,t) * recycle_gov(z,t) - SUM(i1, PC(i1,z,t) * QDAC(z,t) * DAC_Tech_Coeff(i1));
4698   
4699   EQ16_1(z,t)..
4700      TCTAX(z,t) =e= SUM((ene,j), PC(ene,z,t) * CTAX(z,t) * CO2FACTOR2(ene,j,z,t) * DE(ene,j,z,t));
4701   
4702   EQ17(z,t)..
4703      TPRODN(z,t) =e= TIWT(z,t) + TIKT(z,t) + TIPT(z,t);
4704   
4705  EQ18(z,t)..
4706      TIWT(z,t) =e= SUM[(j)$LDO(j,z), TIW(j,z,t)] ;
4707   
4708   EQ19(z,t)..
4709      TIKT(z,t) =e= SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z), TIK(k,j,z,t)] ;
4710   
4711   EQ20(z,t)..
4712      TIPT(z,t) =e= SUM[j, TIP(j,z,t)] ;
4713   
4714   EQ21(z,t)..
4715      TPRCTS(z,t) =e= TICT(z,t) + TIMT(z,t) + TIXT(z,t);
4716   
4717   EQ22(z,t)..
4718      TICT(z,t) =e= SUM[i, TIC(i,z,t)];
4719   
4720   EQ23(z,t)..
4721      TIMT(z,t) =e= SUM[(i,zj)$IMO(i,zj,z), TIM(i,zj,z,t)];
4722   
4723   EQ24(z,t)..
4724      TIXT(z,t) =e= SUM[(i,zj)$EXO(i,z,zj), TIX(i,z,zj,t)];
4725   
4726   EQ25(z,t)..
4727      TDH(z,t) =e= PIXCON(z,t)**eta * ttdh0(z,t) + ttdh1(z,t) * YH(z,t);
4728   
4729   EQ26(j,z,t)$LDO(j,z)..
4730      TIW(j,z,t) =e= ttiw(j,z,t) * W(z,t) * (LD(j,z,t)) - LaborRebate(j,z,t);
4731   
4732   EQ27(k,j,z,t)$KDO(k,j,z)..
4733      TIK(k,j,z,t) =e= ttik(k,j,z,t) * R(k,j,z,t) * (KD(k,j,z,t));
4734   
4735   EQ28(j,z,t)..
4736      TIP(j,z,t) =e= ttip(j,z,t) * PP(j,z,t) * XST(j,z,t);
4737   
4738   EQ29(i,z,t)..
4739      TIC(i,z,t) =e= ttic(i,z,t) * {
4740                     [PL(i,z,t) * DD(i,z,t)]$DDO(i,z)
4741                   + [SUM[zj$IMO(i,zj,z), (1 + ttim(i,zj,z,t)) * IM(i,zj,z,t) * e(z,t)
4742                     *(PWM(i,zj,z,t) + SUM(ij, PWMG(ij,t) * tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)))]]
4743                   };
4744   
4745   EQ30(i,zj,z,t)$IMO(i,zj,z)..
4746      TIM(i,zj,z,t) =e= ttim(i,zj,z,t) * IM(i,zj,z,t) * e(z,t) * (PWM(i,zj,z,t) + SUM[ij, PWMG(ij,t) * tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)]);
4747   
4748   EQ31(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4749      TIX(i,z,zj,t) =e= ttix(i,z,zj,t) * PE(i,z,zj,t) * EX(i,z,zj,t);
4750   
4751   EQ32(z,t)..
4752      SG(z,t) =e= YG(z,t) - G(z,t);
4753   
4754  *==============================================================================
4755  * 5.3.2.4 Rest of the world
4756  *==============================================================================
4757   EQ33(z,t)..
4758      YROW(z,t) =e= e(z,t) * SUM{(i,zj)$IMO(i,zj,z), IM(i,zj,z,t) * [PWM(i,zj,z,t) + SUM(ij, PWMG(ij,t) * tmrg(ij,i,zj,z))]}+YROW_RES(z);
4759   
4760   EQ34(z,t)..
4761      SROW(z,t) =e= YROW(z,t) - e(z,t) * SUM[(i,zj)$EXO(i,z,zj), EX(i,z,zj,t) * PWX(i,z,zj,t)]
4762                    - e(z,t) * SUM[i$MRGNO(i,z), MRGN(i,z,t) * PWMG(i,t)];
4763   
4764   EQ35(z,t)..
4765      SROW(z,t) =e= -CAB(z,t);
4766   
4767  *==============================================================================
4768  * 5.3.3 Demand
4769  *==============================================================================
4770   EQ36(i,z,t)..
4771      PC(i,z,t) * C(i,z,t) =e= PC(i,z,t) * (CMIN(i,z,t))
4772                             + gamma_LES(i,z) * {CTH(z,t) - SUM[ij, PC(ij,z,t) * (CMIN(ij,z,t))]};
4773   
4774   EQ37(i,z,t)..
4775      PC(i,z,t) * INV(i,z,t) =e= gamma_INV(i,z) * IT(z,t);
4776   
4777   EQ38(i,z,t)..
4778      PC(i,z,t) * CG(i,z,t) =e= gamma_GVT(i,z) * G(z,t);
4779   
4780   EQ39(nene,z,t)..
4781      DIT(nene,z,t) =e= SUM[j, DI(nene,j,z,t)];
4782   
4783   EQ39_1(ene1,z,t)..
4784      DIT(ene1,z,t) =e= SUM[j, DE(ene1,j,z,t)];
4785   
4786   EQ39_2(ene2,z,t)..
4787      DIT(ene2,z,t) =e= SUM[j, DE(ene2,j,z,t)];
4788   
4789  *==============================================================================
4790  * 5.3.4 International trade
4791  *==============================================================================
4792   EQA_1(z,t)..
4793      XS('18_TnD','18_ELEC',z,t) =e= TnDShare(z) * XS_I('18_ELEC',z,t);
4794   
4795   EQA_2(z,t)..
4796      XS_I('18_ELEC',z,t) =e= XS('18_TnD','18_ELEC',z,t) + QPOWER(z,t);
4797   
4798   EQA_3(BS, Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, t)$MAP_BS(BS, Conv, I_BS)..
4799      XS_I(I_BS, Z_GRN, t) =e= QBS(BS, Z_GRN, t);
4800   
4801   EQA_3_OTH(BS, Conv, I_BS, Z_OTH, t)$MAP_BS(BS, Conv, I_BS)..
4802      XS_I(I_BS, Z_OTH, t) =e= XS(Conv, I_BS, Z_OTH, t);
4803   
4804   EQA_4(z,t)..
4805      QPOWER(z,t) =e= B_X4(z) * SUM[POWER, beta_X4(power,z) * XS(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t)**(-rho_X4(z))]**(-1 / rho_X4(z));
4806   
4807   EQA_5(power,'18_ELEC',z,t)..
4808      XS(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t) =e= QPOWER(z,t) / B_X4(z)**(1 - sigma_X4(z)) *
4809                                  [beta_X4(power,z) * PPOWER(z,t) / P2(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t)]**sigma_X4(z);
4810   
4811  EQA_6(BS, Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, t)$MAP_BS(BS, Conv, I_BS)..
4812      QBS(BS, Z_GRN, t) =e= B_BS(BS, Z_GRN) * (
4813            beta_BS_t(Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, t) * XS(Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, t)**(-rho_BS(BS, Z_GRN))
4814          + beta_BS_t(BS, I_BS, Z_GRN, t) * XS(BS, I_BS, Z_GRN, t)**(-rho_BS(BS, Z_GRN))
4815      )**(-1 / rho_BS(BS, Z_GRN));
4816   
4817   EQA_7_CONV(BS, Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, t)$MAP_BS(BS, Conv, I_BS)..
4818      XS(Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, t) =e= QBS(BS, Z_GRN, t) / B_BS(BS, Z_GRN)**(1 - sigma_BS(BS, Z_GRN)) *
4819          [beta_BS_t(Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, t) * PBS(BS, Z_GRN, t) / P2(Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, t)]**sigma_BS(BS, Z_GRN);
4820   
4821   EQA_7_BS(BS, Conv, I_BS, Z_GRN, t)$MAP_BS(BS, Conv, I_BS)..
4822      XS(BS, I_BS, Z_GRN, t) =e= QBS(BS, Z_GRN, t) / B_BS(BS, Z_GRN)**(1 - sigma_BS(BS, Z_GRN)) *
4823          [beta_BS_t(BS, I_BS, Z_GRN, t) * PBS(BS, Z_GRN, t) / P2(BS, I_BS, Z_GRN, t)]**sigma_BS(BS, Z_GRN);
4824   
4825   EQB_1(i2,z,t)..
4826      XS_I(i2,z,t) =e= B_X3(i2,z) * SUM[j$XSO(j,i2,z), beta_X3(j,i2,z) * XS(j,i2,z,t)**(-rho_X3(i2,z))]**(-1 / rho_X3(i2,z));
4827   
4828   EQB_2(j,i2,z,t)${DSO(j,i2,z) and [DSO(j,i2,z) ne DSO_I(i2,z)]}..
4829      XS(j,i2,z,t) =e= XS_I(i2,z,t) / B_X3(i2,z)**(1 - sigma_X3(i2,z)) *[beta_X3(j,i2,z) * P(i2,z,t) / P2(j,i2,z,t)]**sigma_X3(i2,z);
4830   
4831   EQB_3(j,i,z,t)${DSO(j,i,z)}..
4832      P2(j,i,z,t) =e= PT(j,z,t);
4833   
4834   EQB_4(j,i,z,t)$DSO(j,i,z)..
4835  *    P2(j,i,z,t) * XS(j,i,z,t) =e= [PET(i,z,t) * EXTT(j,i,z,t)]$EXTTO(j,i,z)
4836  *                                + [e(z,t) * MRGN(i,z,t) * PWMG(i,t)]$MRGNO(i,z)
4837  *                                + [PL(i,z,t) * DS(j,i,z,t)]$DSO(j,i,z);
4838   
4839      P2(j,i,z,t) * XS(j,i,z,t) =e= [PET(i,z,t) * EXTT(j,i,z,t)]$EXTTO(j,i,z)
4840                                  + [e(z,t) * MRGN(i,z,t) * PWMG(i,t) * SHR_MRGN(j,i,z)]$MRGNO(i,z)
4841                                  + [PL(i,z,t) * DS(j,i,z,t)]$DSO(j,i,z);
4842   
4843   EQB_5(j,i,z,t)$DSO(j,i,z)..
4844      EXTT(j,i,z,t) =e= theta2(j,i,z) * EXT(i,z,t);
4845   
4846   EQ40_3(i,z,t)..
4847      DS_I(i,z,t) =e= SUM(j, DS(j,i,z,t)$DSO(j,i,z));
4848   
4849   EQ40_4(j,z,t)..
4850      XST(j,z,t)  =e= SUM(i, XS(j,i,z,t)$XSO(j,i,z));
4851   
4852   EQ40_5(i,z,t)..
4853      XS_I(i,z,t) =e= B_X1(i,z) * {
4854                      [beta_EX_X1(i,z) * EXT(i,z,t)**rho_X1(i,z)]$EXTO(i,z)
4855                    + [beta_D_X1(i,z) * DS_I(i,z,t)**rho_X1(i,z)]$DSO_I(i,z)
4856                    + [(1 - beta_EX_X1(i,z) - beta_D_X1(i,z)) * MRGN(i,z,t)**rho_X1(i,z)]$MRGNO(i,z)
4857                    }**(1 / rho_X1(i,z));
4858   
4859   EQ41(i,z,t)$[EXTO(i,z) and DSO_I(i,z)]..
4860      EXT(i,z,t) =e= {[beta_D_X1(i,z) / beta_EX_X1(i,z)] * [PET(i,z,t) / PL(i,z,t)]}**sigma_X1(i,z) * DS_I(i,z,t);
4861   
4862   EQ42(i,z,t)$[MRGNO(i,z) and DSO_I(i,z)]..
4863      MRGN(i,z,t) =e= {[beta_D_X1(i,z) / (1 - beta_EX_X1(i,z) - beta_D_X1(i,z))] * [e(z,t) * PWMG(i,t) / PL(i,z,t)]}**sigma_X1(i,z) * DS_I(i,z,t);
4864   
4865   EQ43(i,z,t)$EXTO(i,z)..
4866      EXT(i,z,t) =e= B_X2(i,z) * SUM[zj$EXO(i,z,zj), beta_X2(i,z,zj) * EX(i,z,zj,t)**rho_X2(i,z)]**(1 / rho_X2(i,z));
4867   
4868   EQ44(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4869      EX(i,z,zj,t) =e= EXT(i,z,t) / B_X2(i,z)**(1 + sigma_X2(i,z)) *
4870                       [PE(i,z,zj,t) / (beta_X2(i,z,zj) * PET(i,z,t))]**sigma_X2(i,z);
4871   
4872   EQ45(i,z,t)..
4873      Q(i,z,t) =e= B_M1(i,z) * {
4874                   [beta_M1(i,z) * IMT(i,z,t)**(-rho_M1(i,z))]$IMTO(i,z)
4875                 + [(1 - beta_M1(i,z)) * DD(i,z,t)**(-rho_M1(i,z))]$DDO(i,z)
4876                   }**(-1 / rho_M1(i,z));
4877   
4878   EQ46(i,z,t)$[IMTO(i,z) and DDO(i,z)]..
4879      IMT(i,z,t) =e= {[beta_M1(i,z) / (1 - beta_M1(i,z))] * [PD(i,z,t) / PMT(i,z,t)]}**sigma_M1(i,z) * DD(i,z,t);
4880   
4881   EQ47(i,z,t)$IMTO(i,z)..
4882      IMT(i,z,t) =e= B_M2(i,z) * SUM[zj$IMO(i,zj,z), beta_M2(i,zj,z) * IM(i,zj,z,t)**(-rho_M2(i,z))]**(-1 / rho_M2(i,z));
4883   
4884   EQ48(i,zj,z,t)$IMO(i,zj,z)..
4885      IM(i,zj,z,t) =e= IMT(i,z,t) / B_M2(i,z)**(1 - sigma_M2(i,z)) *
4886                       [beta_M2(i,zj,z) * PMT(i,z,t) / PM(i,zj,z,t)]**sigma_M2(i,z);
4887   
4888  *==============================================================================
4889  * 5.3.5 Prices
4890  *==============================================================================
4891   EQ49(j2,z,t)..
4892      PP(j2,z,t) * XST(j2,z,t) =e= PKLE(j2,z,t) * KLE(j2,z,t) + PCI(j2,z,t) * CI(j2,z,t);
4893   
4894  EQ49_1(j3,z,t)$[not BS(j3)]..
4895      PP(j3,z,t) * XST(j3,z,t) =e= PVA(j3,z,t) * VA(j3,z,t) + PCI(j3,z,t) * CI(j3,z,t) + PCE(j3,z,t) * CE(j3,z,t);
4896   
4897   EQ50(j,z,t)..
4898      PT(j,z,t) =e= (1 + ttip(j,z,t)) * PP(j,z,t);
4899   
4900   EQ51(j,z,t)..
4901      PCI(j,z,t) * CI(j,z,t) =e= SUM[nene, PC(nene,z,t) * DI(nene,j,z,t)];
4902   
4903   EQ51_2(j3,z,t)..
4904      PCE(j3,z,t) * CE(j3,z,t) =e= SUM[ene, PC(ene,z,t) * DE(ene,j3,z,t) + PC(ene,z,t) * CTAX(z,t) * CO2FACTOR2(ene,j3,z,t) * DE(ene,j3,z,t)];
4905   
4906   EQ51_1(j2,z,t)..
4907      PCE(j2,z,t) * CE(j2,z,t) =e= [PCEelec(j2,z,t) * DEelec(j2,z,t) + PCEnelec(j2,z,t) * DEnelec(j2,z,t)];
4908   
4909   EQ51_3(j2,z,t)..
4910      PCEelec(j2,z,t) * DEelec(j2,z,t) =e= PC("18_ELEC",z,t) * DE("18_ELEC",j2,z,t);
4911   
4912   EQ51_4(j2,z,t)..
4913      PCEnelec(j2,z,t) * DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= [PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t) * DEcoalgas(j2,z,t) + PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) * DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)];
4914   
4915   EQ51_5(j2,z,t)..
4916      PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t) * DEcoalgas(j2,z,t) =e= [PC("02_COAL",z,t) * DE("02_COAL",j2,z,t) + PC("02_COAL",z,t) * CTAX(z,t) * CO2FACTOR2("02_COAL",j2,z,t) * DE("02_COAL",j2,z,t)
4917                                               + PC("04_GAS",z,t) * DE("04_GAS",j2,z,t) + PC("04_GAS",z,t) * CTAX(z,t) * CO2FACTOR2("04_GAS",j2,z,t) * DE("04_GAS",j2,z,t)];
4918   
4919   EQ51_6(j2,z,t)..
4920      PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) * DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) =e= [PC("03_OIL",z,t) * DE("03_OIL",j2,z,t) + PC("03_OIL",z,t) * CTAX(z,t) * CO2FACTOR2("03_OIL",j2,z,t) * DE("03_OIL",j2,z,t)
4921                                                   + PC("10_PETROLCOAL",z,t) * DE("10_PETROLCOAL",j2,z,t) + PC("10_PETROLCOAL",z,t) * CTAX(z,t) * CO2FACTOR2("10_PETROLCOAL",j2,z,t) * DE("10_PETROLCOAL",j2,z,t)];
4922   
4923  EQ52(j,z,t)..
4924      PVA(j,z,t) * VA(j,z,t) =e= [WC(j,z,t) * LDC(j,z,t)]$LDCO(j,z)
4925                               + [RC(j,z,t) * KDC(j,z,t)]$KDCO(j,z);
4926   
4927   EQ52_1(j2,z,t)..
4928      PKLE(j2,z,t) * KLE(j2,z,t) =e= [PVA(j2,z,t) * VA(j2,z,t)]$VAO(j2,z)
4929                                   + [PCE(j2,z,t) * CE(j2,z,t)]$CEO(j2,z);
4930   
4931   EQ53(j,z,t)..
4932      WC(j,z,t) * LDC(j,z,t) =e= WTI(j,z,t) * (LD(j,z,t));
4933   
4934   EQ54(j,z,t)$LDO(j,z)..
4935      WTI(j,z,t) * LD(j,z,t) =e= W(z,t) * (1 + ttiw(j,z,t)) * LD(j,z,t) - LaborRebate(j,z,t);
4936   
4937   EQ54_1(ene,j2,z,t)$DEO(ene,j2,z)..
4938      P4(ene,j2,z,t) =e= PC(ene,z,t);
4939   
4940   EQ56(k,j,z,t)$KDO(k,j,z)..
4941      RTI(k,j,z,t) =e= R(k,j,z,t) * (1 + ttik(k,j,z,t));
4942   
4943   EQ58(i,z,t)..
4944      P(i,z,t) * XS_I(i,z,t) =e= [PL(i,z,t) * DS_I(i,z,t)]$DSO_I(i,z)
4945                               + [PET(i,z,t) * EXT(i,z,t)]$EXTO(i,z)
4946                               + [e(z,t) * PWMG(i,t) * MRGN(i,z,t)]$MRGNO(i,z);
4947   
4948   EQ60(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4949      PE(i,z,zj,t) * (1 + ttix(i,z,zj,t)) =e= e(z,t) * PWX(i,z,zj,t);
4950   
4951   EQ61(i,z,t)$DDO(i,z)..
4952      PD(i,z,t) =e= (1 + ttic(i,z,t)) * PL(i,z,t);
4953   
4954   EQ62(i,zj,z,t)$IMO(i,zj,z)..
4955      PM(i,zj,z,t) =e= (1 + ttic(i,z,t)) * (1 + ttim(i,zj,z,t)) * e(z,t) * (PWM(i,zj,z,t) + SUM[ij, PWMG(ij,t) * tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)]);
4956   
4957   EQ64(i,z,t)..
4958      PC(i,z,t) * Q(i,z,t) =e= [PD(i,z,t) * DD(i,z,t)]$DDO(i,z) + [PMT(i,z,t) * IMT(i,z,t)]$IMTO(i,z);
4959   
4960  EQ66(z,t)..
4961      PIXGDP(z,t) =e= {
4962        ( SUM[j$XSTO(j,z), {(PVA(j,z,t) * VA(j,z,t) + TIP(j,z,t)) / VA(j,z,t)} * VAO(j,z)]
4963          + SUM[(BS, Z_GRN)$(sameas(z, Z_GRN) and XSTO(BS, Z_GRN)), PTSF(BS, Z_GRN, t) * TSFO(BS, Z_GRN)] )
4964        /
4965        ( SUM[j$XSTO(j,z), {(PVAO(j,z) * VAO(j,z) + TIPO(j,z)) / VAO(j,z)} * VAO(j,z)]
4966          + SUM[(BS, Z_GRN)$(sameas(z, Z_GRN) and XSTO(BS, Z_GRN)), PTSFO(BS, Z_GRN) * TSFO(BS, Z_GRN)] )
4967        * ( SUM[j$XSTO(j,z), {(PVA(j,z,t) * VA(j,z,t) + TIP(j,z,t)) / VA(j,z,t)} * VA(j,z,t)]
4968          + SUM[(BS, Z_GRN)$(sameas(z, Z_GRN) and XSTO(BS, Z_GRN)), PTSF(BS, Z_GRN, t) * TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t)] )
4969        /
4970        ( SUM[j$XSTO(j,z), {(PVAO(j,z) * VAO(j,z) + TIPO(j,z)) / VAO(j,z)} * VA(j,z,t)]
4971          + SUM[(BS, Z_GRN)$(sameas(z, Z_GRN) and XSTO(BS, Z_GRN)), PTSFO(BS, Z_GRN) * TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t)] )
4972      }**0.5;
4973   
4974   EQ67(t)..
4975      PIXGDP_W(t) =e= {
4976        ( SUM[(j,z)$XSTO(j,z), {(PVA(j,z,t) * VA(j,z,t) + TIP(j,z,t)) / VA(j,z,t)} * VAO(j,z) / e(z,t)]
4977          + SUM[(BS, Z_GRN)$XSTO(BS, Z_GRN), PTSF(BS, Z_GRN, t) * TSFO(BS, Z_GRN) / e(Z_GRN, t)] )
4978        /
4979        ( SUM[(j,z)$XSTO(j,z), {(PVAO(j,z) * VAO(j,z) + TIPO(j,z)) / VAO(j,z)} * VAO(j,z) / eO(z)]
4980          + SUM[(BS, Z_GRN)$XSTO(BS, Z_GRN), PTSFO(BS, Z_GRN) * TSFO(BS, Z_GRN) / eO(Z_GRN)] )
4981        * ( SUM[(j,z)$XSTO(j,z), {(PVA(j,z,t) * VA(j,z,t) + TIP(j,z,t)) / VA(j,z,t)} * VA(j,z,t) / e(z,t)]
4982          + SUM[(BS, Z_GRN)$XSTO(BS, Z_GRN), PTSF(BS, Z_GRN, t) * TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t) / e(Z_GRN, t)] )
4983        /
4984        ( SUM[(j,z)$XSTO(j,z), {(PVAO(j,z) * VAO(j,z) + TIPO(j,z)) / VAO(j,z)} * VA(j,z,t) / eO(z)]
4985          + SUM[(BS, Z_GRN)$XSTO(BS, Z_GRN), PTSFO(BS, Z_GRN) * TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t) / eO(Z_GRN)] )
4986      }**0.5;
4987   
4988   EQ68(z,t)..
4989      PIXCON(z,t) =e= SUM[i, PC(i,z,t) * CO(i,z)] / SUM[i, PCO(i,z) * CO(i,z)];
4990   
4991   EQ69(z,t)..
4992      PIXINV(z,t) =e= PROD[i$gamma_INV(i,z), (PC(i,z,t) / PCO(i,z))**gamma_INV(i,z)];
4993   
4994   EQ70(z,t)..
4995      PIXGVT(z,t) =e= PROD[i$gamma_GVT(i,z), (PC(i,z,t) / PCO(i,z))**gamma_GVT(i,z)];
4996   
4997  *==============================================================================
4998  * 5.3.6 Equilibrium
4999  *==============================================================================
5000  EQ71(i1,z,t)..
5001      Q(i1,z,t) =e= C(i1,z,t) + CG(i1,z,t) + INV(i1,z,t) + DIT(i1,z,t) + (QDAC(z,t) * DAC_Tech_Coeff(i1)) ;
5002   
5003   EQ72(z,t)..
5004      LS(z,t) =e= SUM[j$LDO(j,z), LD(j,z,t)] ;
5005   
5006   EQ73(k,z,t)$KSO(k,z)..
5007      KS(k,z,t) =e= SUM[j$KDO(k,j,z), KD(k,j,z,t)] ;
5008   
5009   EQ74(z,t)..
5010      IT(z,t) =e= SH(z,t) + SG(z,t) - CAB(z,t);
5011   
5012   EQ75(z,t)..
5013      DEP(z,t) =e= PK(z,t) * delta(z) * SUM[k$KSO(k,z), KS(k,z,t)];
5014   
5015   EQ76(i,z,t)$DDO(i,z)..
5016      SUM[j$DSO(j,i,z), DS(j,i,z,t)] =e= DD(i,z,t);
5017   
5018   EQ77(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
5019      EX(i,z,zj,t) =e= IM(i,z,zj,t);
5020   
5021   EQ78(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
5022      PWX(i,z,zj,t) =e= PWM(i,z,zj,t);
5023   
5024   EQ79(i,t)..
5025      SUM[z$MRGNO(i,z), MRGN(i,z,t)] =e= SUM[(z,zj,ij)$IMO(ij,zj,z), tmrg(i,ij,zj,z) * IM(ij,zj,z,t)]+MRGN_RES(i) ;
5026   
5027  *==============================================================================
5028  * 5.3.7 Gross domestic product
5029  *==============================================================================
5030   EQ81(z,t)..
5031      GDP_BP(z,t) =e= SUM[j, PVA(j,z,t) * VA(j,z,t)] + TIPT(z,t)
5032                    + SUM((BS, Z_GRN)$sameas(z, Z_GRN), PTSF(BS, Z_GRN, t) * TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t));
5033   
5034   EQ82(z,t)..
5035      GDP_MP(z,t) =e= GDP_BP(z,t) + TPRCTS(z,t) + TCTAX(z,t);
5036   
5037   EQ83(z,t)..
5038      GDP_IB(z,t) =e= SUM[(j)$LDO(j,z), W(z,t) * (LD(j,z,t))]
5039                    + SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z), R(k,j,z,t) * (KD(k,j,z,t))]
5040                    + SUM((BS, Z_GRN)$sameas(z, Z_GRN), PTSF(BS, Z_GRN, t) * TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t))
5041                    + TPRCTS(z,t) + TPRODN(z,t) + TCTAX(z,t);
5042   
5043   EQ84(z,t)..
5044      GDP_FD(z,t) =e= SUM[i, PC(i,z,t) * (C(i,z,t) + CG(i,z,t) + INV(i,z,t))]
5045                    + SUM[(i,zj)$EXO(i,z,zj), e(z,t) * PWX(i,z,zj,t) * EX(i,z,zj,t)]
5046                    + SUM[i$MRGNO(i,z), e(z,t) * PWMG(i,t) * MRGN(i,z,t)]
5047                    - SUM[(i,zj)$IMO(i,zj,z), e(z,t) * IM(i,zj,z,t) * (PWM(i,zj,z,t) + SUM[ij, PWMG(ij,t) * tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)])]
5048                    + SUM(i1, PC(i1,z,t) * QDAC(z,t) * DAC_Tech_Coeff(i1));
5049   
5050   EQ85(t)..
5051      GDP_BP_W(t) =e= SUM[z, GDP_BP(z,t) / e(z,t)];
5052   
5053  *==============================================================================
5054  * 5.3.8 Real (volume) variables computed from price indices
5055  *==============================================================================
5056   EQ86(z,t)..
5057      CTH_REAL(z,t) =e= CTH(z,t) / PIXCON(z,t);
5058   
5059   EQ87(z,t)..
5060      G_REAL(z,t) =e= G(z,t) / PIXGVT(z,t);
5061   
5062   EQ88(z,t)..
5063      GDP_BP_REAL(z,t) =e= GDP_BP(z,t) / PIXGDP(z,t);
5064   
5065   EQ89(t)..
5066      GDP_BP_W_REAL(t) =e= GDP_BP_W(t) / PIXGDP_W(t);
5067   
5068   EQ90(z,t)..
5069      GDP_MP_REAL(z,t) =e= GDP_MP(z,t) / PIXCON(z,t);
5070   
5071   EQ91(z,t)..
5072      IT_REAL(z,t) =e= IT(z,t) / PIXINV(z,t);
5073   
5074   EQ92(z,t)..
5075      CABX(z,t) =e= CAB(z,t) / [PIXGDP_W(t) * e(z,t)];
5076   
5077  *==============================================================================
5078  * 5.3.8 Dynamic equations
5079  *==============================================================================
5080   EQ94(z,t)..
5081      IT(z,t) =e= PK(z,t) * SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z), IND(k,j,z,t)];
5082   
5083   EQ95(z,t)..
5084      PK(z,t) =e= 1 / A_K(z) * PROD[i$gamma_INV(i,z), (PC(i,z,t) / gamma_INV(i,z))**gamma_INV(i,z)];
5085   
5086   EQ96(k,bus,z,t)$KDO(k,bus,z)..
5087      IND(k,bus,z,t) =e= phi(z,t) * [R(k,bus,z,t) / U(z,t)]**sigma_INV(k,bus,z) * (KD(k,bus,z,t));
5088   
5089   EQ97a(z,t)..
5090      IR(z,t) =e= {SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z), R(k,j,z,t) * (KD(k,j,z,t))] - DEP(z,t)} /
5091                  {PK(z,t) * SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z), (KD(k,j,z,t))]};
5092   
5093   EQ97b(z,t)..
5094      U(z,t) =e= PK(z,t) * (delta(z) + IR(z,t));
5095   
5096  *==============================================================================
5097  * 5.3.9 Other
5098  *==============================================================================
5099   WALRAS(z,t)..
5100      LEON(z,t) =e= Q('01_AGRICULT',z,t) - C('01_AGRICULT',z,t) - CG('01_AGRICULT',z,t) - INV('01_AGRICULT',z,t) - DIT('01_AGRICULT',z,t);
5101   
5102  *================================================================================
5103  * 6 Labour Supply
5104  *================================================================================
5105   EQ106(z,t)..
5106      LS(z,t) =e= LST(z,t) * ((W(z,t) / PIXCON(z,t)) / (W_lag(z,t) / PIXCON_lag(z,t)))**elasLS(z);
5107   
5108  *==============================================================================
5109  * 7 PERMIT
5110  *==============================================================================
5111   EQ107(j,z,t)..
5112      PERMIT(j,z,t) =e= SUM(ene, CO2FACTOR2(ene,j,z,t) * DE(ene,j,z,t));
5113   
5114   EQ108(z,t)..
5115      PERMIT_TOTAL(z,t) =e= SUM(j, PERMIT(j,z,t)) - QDAC(z,t) * switchDAC(z,t);
5116   
5117   EQ108_1(t)..
5118      PERMIT_NEA_TOTAL(t) =e= SUM(NEA, PERMIT_TOTAL(NEA,t));
5119   
5120  *==============================================================================
5121  * 8 Carbon Tax Revenue Recycling
5122  *==============================================================================
5123   EQ109(z,t)..
5124      REBATE(z,t) =e= TCTAX(z,t);
5125   
5126   EQ110(j,z,t)..
5127      TIW_Share(j,z,t) =e= LD(j,z,t) / SUM(jj, LD(jj,z,t));
5128   
5129   EQ111(j,z,t)..
5130      LaborRebate(j,z,t) =e= TIW_Share(j,z,t) * TCTAX(z,t) * recycle_labor(z,t);
5131   
5132  *==============================================================================
5133  * 9 DAC
5134  *==============================================================================
5135   EQ118(z,t)..
5136      QDAC(z,t) =e= DAC_MAX(z) * DAC_growth_rate(z,t) * switchDAC(z,t);
5137   
5138   EQ_OBJ..
5139      OBJ =e= 1.0;
5140   
5141  *==============================================================================
5142  * 10 TSF Equations - CES
5143  *==============================================================================
5144   EQ_PP_GRN(BS, Z_GRN, t)..
5145      PP(BS, Z_GRN, t) * XST(BS, Z_GRN, t) =e= PVAT(BS, Z_GRN, t) * VAT(BS, Z_GRN, t)
5146                                             + PCI(BS, Z_GRN, t) * CI(BS, Z_GRN, t)
5147                                             + PCE(BS, Z_GRN, t) * CE(BS, Z_GRN, t);
5148   
5149   EQ_VA_GRN(BS, Z_GRN, t)..
5150      VA(BS, Z_GRN, t) =e= VAT(BS, Z_GRN, t)
5151                         * (beta_VAT(BS, Z_GRN) * PVAT(BS, Z_GRN, t) / PVA(BS, Z_GRN, t))**sigma_VAT(BS, Z_GRN)
5152                         * (B_VAT_t(BS, Z_GRN, t))**(sigma_VAT(BS, Z_GRN) - 1);
5153   
5154   EQ_VAT_REQ(BS, Z_GRN, t)..
5155      VAT(BS, Z_GRN, t) =e= v_vat(BS, Z_GRN) * XST(BS, Z_GRN, t);
5156   
5157  EQ_PVAT(BS, Z_GRN, t)..
5158      PVAT(BS, Z_GRN, t) * VAT(BS, Z_GRN, t) =e= PVA(BS, Z_GRN, t) * VA(BS, Z_GRN, t)
5159                                               + PTSF(BS, Z_GRN, t) * TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t);
5160   
5161   EQ_TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t)..
5162      TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t) =e= VAT(BS, Z_GRN, t)
5163                           * ((1 - beta_VAT(BS, Z_GRN)) * PVAT(BS, Z_GRN, t) / PTSF(BS, Z_GRN, t))**sigma_VAT(BS, Z_GRN)
5164                           * (B_VAT_t(BS, Z_GRN, t))**(sigma_VAT(BS, Z_GRN) - 1);
5165   
5166   EQ_TSFMKT(BS, Z_GRN, t)..
5167      TSFS(BS, Z_GRN, t) =e= TSFD(BS, Z_GRN, t);
5168   
5169  *==============================================================================
5170  * 6 Numerical resolution to compute A_VA, sh0, G, G_REAL and IND
5171  *==============================================================================
5172  option cns = conopt4;
5173  *option cns = path;
5174  *option cns = minos;
5175  *option nlp = conopt4;
5176   
5177  *option iterlim = 0;
5178  *option limrow = 100, limcol = 100;
5179  *option conopt4.TolPiv = 1e-6;
5180  *option iterlim = 100;
5181  *option reslim = 1000;
5182  *option lmmxsf = t ;
5183  *Eliminating display of solution makes it easier to check whether model solves
5184  *and to identify year when it crashes.
5185  *option profile=1;
5186  *option profile=3;
5187  *option profiletol=10;
5188   
5189  *Fast solve option
5190  option profile=0;
5191  option limrow=0, limcol=0, solprint = off;

